{
  "kind": "codes",
  "doc": "plugin-qualify's own codes, each with its source sentence in English and the args it names (omx-contract's codes shape; translations are not here): the code its scan refuses a plugin by, and the verdict and reason sentences of its comparison and of its pin. Each language's sentences are in catalogs/<lang>.json, keyed by the code. tools/descriptors.py and src/text-catalog.ts render the English sentence from this file; no module repeats it. A code is never reworded.",
